---
// AuthorBio component for blog posts
---

<div class="author-bio">
	<div class="author-header">
		<div class="author-avatar">
			<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="48" height="48">
				<path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm0 3c1.66 0 3 1.34 3 3s-1.34 3-3 3-3-1.34-3-3 1.34-3 3-3zm0 14.2c-2.5 0-4.71-1.28-6-3.22.03-1.99 4-3.08 6-3.08 1.99 0 5.97 1.09 6 3.08-1.29 1.94-3.5 3.22-6 3.22z"/>
			</svg>
		</div>
		<div class="author-info">
			<h3>About the Author</h3>
			<p class="author-name">Intently Team</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	<p class="author-description">
		Written by the <strong>Intently Team</strong>, experts in digital wellbeing and behavioral psychology. We're building privacy-first tools to help people develop healthier relationships with technology. Our mission is to empower mindful tech usage through compassionate interventions, not restrictive blocking.
	</p>
	<a href="/about" class="author-link">Learn more about Intently →</a>
</div>

<style>
.author-bio {
	margin-top: var(--intently-space-3xl);
	padding: var(--intently-space-2xl);
	background: var(--intently-bg-secondary);
	border-radius: var(--intently-radius-lg);
	border: 1px solid var(--intently-gray-200);
}

.author-header {
	display: flex;
	align-items: center;
	gap: var(--intently-space-lg);
	margin-bottom: var(--intently-space-lg);
}

.author-avatar {
	width: 64px;
	height: 64px;
	background: var(--intently-blue);
	color: white;
	border-radius: 50%;
	display: flex;
	align-items: center;
	justify-content: center;
	flex-shrink: 0;
}

.author-info h3 {
	font-size: 1rem;
	font-weight: 600;
	margin: 0 0 var(--intently-space-xs);
	color: var(--intently-text-secondary);
	text-transform: uppercase;
	letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}

.author-name {
	font-size: 1.25rem;
	font-weight: 700;
	margin: 0;
	color: var(--intently-text-primary);
}

.author-description {
	line-height: 1.7;
	margin: 0 0 var(--intently-space-lg);
	color: var(--intently-text-secondary);
	font-size: 1rem;
}

.author-description strong {
	color: var(--intently-text-primary);
	font-weight: 600;
}

.author-link {
	display: inline-flex;
	align-items: center;
	color: var(--intently-blue);
	font-weight: 600;
	text-decoration: none;
	border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
	transition: var(--intently-transition-normal);
}

.author-link:hover {
	border-bottom-color: var(--intently-blue);
}

@media (max-width: 767px) {
	.author-bio {
		padding: var(--intently-space-xl);
	}

	.author-header {
		flex-direction: column;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.author-description {
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
	}
}
</style>
